<group data_src="">
<item type="0">
<value>1</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err1:逆变单元保护

可能原因及排除方法:</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err1:ContraVariant Unit Protect

Possible causes and elimination method:</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>2</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err2:加速电流过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器输出回路有接地或短路现象.
2.重新进行电机调谐.
3.寻求技术支持.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err2:Accelerate Current Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the servo drive output
circuit is earthed or short circuited.
2.Perform motor tuning.
3.Contact the agent or our company.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>3</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err3:减速电路过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器输出回路有接地或短路现象.
2.重新进行电机调谐.
3.寻求技术支持.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err3:Reduce Current Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the servo drive output 
circuit is earthed or short circuited.
2.Perform motor tuning.
3.Contact the agent or our company.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>4</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err4:恒速电流过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器输出回路有接地或短路现象.
2.重新进行电机调谐.
3.电机负载过大.
4.加大驱动器容量.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err4:Constant Current Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the servo drive output 
circuit is earthed or short circuited.
2.Perform motor tuning.
3.Check whether the load can be reduced.
4.Increase the capacity level of the servo 
drive.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>5</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err5:加速电压过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器三相输入电压是否过高.
2.增加加速时间.
3.制动电阻阻值是否过大.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err5:Accelerate Voltage Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the servo drive input 
voltage is too high.
2.Increase acceleration time.
3.The braking resistor is too large.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>6</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err6:减速电压过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器三相输入电压是否过高.
2.增加减速时间.
3.制动电阻阻值是否过大.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err6:Reduce Voltage Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the servo drive input 
voltage is too high.
2.Increase deceleration time.
3.The braking resistor is too large.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>7</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err7:恒速电压过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器三相输入电压是否过高.
2.合理加装制动电阻.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err7:Constant Voltage Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the servo drive input 
voltage is too high.
2.Install the braking resistor properly.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>8</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err8:控制电源故障

可能原因及排除方法:</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err8:Control Powder Failure

Possible causes and elimination method:</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>9</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err9:欠压故障

可能原因及排除方法:
1.输入电源电压是否有瞬间断开.
2.驱动器输入端电压是否过低.
3.寻求技术支持.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err9:Low Voltage Failure

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether instantaneous power 
failure occurs.
2.Check whether the servo drive input 
voltage is too low.
3.Contact the agent or our company.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>10</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err10:驱动器过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.请确认FF-01机型和电机参数是否设置正确.
2.电机保护参数F9-01参数设置是否合适.
3.负载过大(转动电机查看轴承是否有卡死)或电
机堵转.
4.加大驱动器容量.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err10:Servo Drive Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether parameter FF-01 or motor 
parameter is correct.
2.Check whether setting of motor protection 
parameter F9-01 is proper.
3.Check whether the load is too heavy or 
the motor is blocked.
4.Increase the capacity level of the servo 
drive.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>11</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err11:电机过载

可能原因及排除方法:
1.请确认FF-01机型和电机参数是否设置正确.
2.电机保护参数F9-01参数设置是否合适.
3.负载过大(转动电机查看轴承是否有卡死)或
电机堵转.
4.加大驱动器容量.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err11:Motor Override

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether parameter FF-01 or motor 
parameter is correct.
2.Check whether setting of motor protection 
parameter F9-01 is proper.
3.Check whether the load is too heavy or 
the motor is blocked.
4.Increase the capacity level of the servo 
drive.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>12</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err12:输入侧缺相

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器三相输入电源缺相.
2.输入端子是否未固定.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err12:Phase Loss at Input Side

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether three-phase input power 
is normal.
2.Check whether the input is fixed.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>13</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err13:输出侧缺相

可能原因及排除方法:
1.检查驱动器到电机的动力电缆及接线端子.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err13:Phase Loss at Output Side

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check from drives to motor of the power 
cable and terminal.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>14</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err14:模块过热

可能原因及排除方法:
1.环境温度太高.
2.风道堵塞,散热效果不理想.
3.寻求技术支持.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err14:Module Overheat

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether ambient temperature is 
too high.
2.Check whether the air filter is blocked.
3.Contact the agent or our company.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
