<item type="0">
<value>23</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err23:对地短路故障

可能原因及排除方法:
1.驱动器输入三相是否对地短路.
2.电机侧三相是否有对外壳短路.
3.更换驱动器.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err23:Short Circuit to Ground

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the drive three-phase
input is earthed or short circuited.
2.Check whether the motor is short 
circuited to ground.
3.Replace the servo drive.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
