<item type="0">
<value>42</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err42:CAN通讯中断故障

可能原因及排除方法:
1.CAN通讯连线有误.
2.驱动器CAN通讯参数设置有误.
3.端子板故障.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err42:CAN COM Interruption

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether CAN COM wiring is wrong.
2.Check whether CAN COM parameters are
 set improperly.
3.It is the terminal block fault.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>43</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err43:电机识别编码器故障

可能原因及排除方法:
1.编码器型号不匹配.
2.编码器安装和连线故障.
3.是否为PG卡故障.
4.是否为控制板故障.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err43:Encoder Fault during Motor Tuning

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the encoder model is 
adapted.
2.Check whether the encoder wiring or 
encoder installation is wrong.
3.Check whether the encoder is normal 
after PG card is replaced.
4.Check whether the encoder is normal 
after controlling block is replaced.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>44</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err44:速度偏差过大故障

可能原因及排除方法:
1.编码器安装和连线故障.
2.电机动力线缆松脱.
3.PG卡故障.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err44:Too Big Speed Deviation

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Check whether the encoder installation 
and wiring become loose.
2.Check whether the motor power cables 
become loose.
3.It is PG card fault.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="0">
<value>45</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">Err45:电机过热

可能原因及排除方法:
1.电机散热风扇故障.
2.检查电机温度保护PTC及接线.
3.电机过载或电机退磁.
4.驱动器端子板故障.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err45:Motor Overheat

Possible causes and elimination method:
1.Motor cooling fan fault.
2.Check whether the motor overheat 
protection PTC wiring is wrong.
3.Motor overload or motor demagnetization.
4.It is terminal block fault.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
