2.更换同类型电机进行测试,请确认电机
是否消磁.</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">Err59:Tuning Fault Counter EMF

